<Doc title="Terms of Use for Macro Release Desk Data Pages and Guides" description="Terms for using Macro Release Desk: information only, no warranty on accuracy or timeliness, how you may quote our pages and agency data, external links and changes to terms." path="/terms/" h1="Terms of use" kicker="Legal · terms" updated="2026-10-15"
  answer="You may read, quote and link to this site for any lawful purpose. Content is provided for information only, without warranty, and is not financial advice. Official agency data remains subject to the agencies’ own terms.">
  <h2>Use of content</h2>
  <p>You may quote short passages and figures with attribution to “Macro Release Desk ({site.domain})” and, for data, to the original agency. Do not republish whole guides or present our pages as your own.</p>
  <p>U.S. federal statistics (BLS, Treasury) are generally in the public domain. Eurostat data is reusable under the European Commission’s reuse policy with attribution. ECB statistics may be reused with the source cited, under the ECB’s terms. Check each agency’s terms before redistributing data.</p>
  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>We work to reproduce official figures accurately, but data can be revised, delayed or mis-transcribed. The site is provided “as is”, without warranties of any kind. Always confirm important figures with the agency source linked on each page.</p>
  <h2>Not advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing on this site is investment, financial, tax or legal advice, or a recommendation to buy or sell any security. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the extent permitted by law, the publisher is not liable for losses arising from use of, or reliance on, this site.</p>
  <h2>External links and ads</h2>
  <p>We link to official sources and display third-party advertising. We are not responsible for the content of external sites or ads.</p>
  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
